2
00:01:31,161 --> 00:01:33,741
[TH] Where are the others?

3
00:01:36,111 --> 00:01:39,823
[TH] Ryuji: They've probably gone back to their previous lives.

4
00:01:40,378 --> 00:01:43,278
[TH] Keith: Fighting's the only thing I'm good at.

5
00:01:44,328 --> 00:01:47,976
[TH] I guess I'll try to find someone who'd hire me in Africa.

6
00:01:51,944 --> 00:01:55,016
[TH] J. J.: I got all the money I need from this war.

7
00:01:56,111 --> 00:01:58,644
[TH] I'm going back to my family in Africa.

8
00:02:03,011 --> 00:02:07,043
[TH] I'm not like you, Keith. I don't need to kill to make a living.

9
00:02:11,211 --> 00:02:14,731
[TH] Keith: Huh. A bit harsh on your old partner, aren't you?

10
00:02:16,828 --> 00:02:20,412
[TH] What the hell. Maybe I'll go visit this family of yours.

11
00:02:26,011 --> 00:02:28,611
[TH] ...It was fun, guys.

12
00:02:36,661 --> 00:02:38,441
[TH] Ryuji: Family...

13
00:02:40,961 --> 00:02:44,481
[TH] Too many things have happened ever since I left mine...

14
00:02:47,544 --> 00:02:48,844
[TH] Too much fighting...

15
00:02:49,561 --> 00:02:50,861
[TH] Too much loss...

16
00:02:51,578 --> 00:02:55,162
[TH] I think... I think I need time to sort everything out...

17
00:03:00,111 --> 00:03:03,311
[TH] Captain... This is where we part ways, I'm afraid.

18
00:03:03,594 --> 00:03:05,194
[TH] ...Goodbye, Captain.

19
00:03:19,978 --> 00:03:22,645
[TH] Nathalie: I'm worried about my father...

20
00:03:23,378 --> 00:03:26,450
[TH] Many will view his actions as acts of treason...

21
00:03:26,994 --> 00:03:31,218
[TH] He may have already been sent to the mainland. I must go find him.

22
00:03:33,744 --> 00:03:35,184
[TH] Goodbye... \NM00...

23
00:03:47,944 --> 00:03:51,784
[TH] Gentz: Unlike the others, I have no other life to return to.

24
00:03:52,211 --> 00:03:56,179
[TH] All I can do is make Huffman a safe place for us to live in...

25
00:03:57,328 --> 00:04:00,828
[TH] \NM00... You and I are much alike.

26
00:04:03,644 --> 00:04:07,508
[TH] Join me. There'd be nothing the two of us can't do.

27
00:04:08,711 --> 00:04:10,691
[TH] \NM00: I can't...

28
00:04:11,311 --> 00:04:13,044
[TH] There's something I want--

29
00:04:14,861 --> 00:04:17,194
[TH] no, something I need to do first...
